WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.988 --> 00:00:17.200
"Hi, Miss Shelly.

2
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.641
What are we doing today?"

3
00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:23.344
Jason was the first to arrive in the gym for Kids Central.

4
00:00:23.364 --> 00:00:25.526
"Hello, Jason.

5
00:00:26.086 --> 00:00:28.648
I can't tell you until everyone else arrives.

6
00:00:29.864 --> 00:00:34.026
But you can help me pass out these index cards," Miss Shelly said.

7
00:00:38.748 --> 00:00:39.968
Nina walked in next.

8
00:00:39.988 --> 00:00:43.950
"What are the cards for?"

9
00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:49.792
"We can't find out until everyone gets here," Jason told her.

10
00:00:51.893 --> 00:00:53.154
Bobby and Izzie walked in.

11
00:00:53.174 --> 00:00:56.595
"Let's start!"

12
00:00:57.075 --> 00:00:58.416
Jason told Miss Shelly.

13
00:00:59.536 --> 00:01:00.437
"Everyone is here."

14
00:01:00.457 --> 00:01:04.119
"Jason, let me sit down first.

15
00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:09.503
Geesh!" Izzie rolled her eyes at Nina and sat down at the table.

16
00:01:09.523 --> 00:01:13.346
"Okay, now I'm ready."

17
00:01:14.947 --> 00:01:19.531
"Today we will do something impossible," Miss Shelly said.

18
00:01:19.551 --> 00:01:21.812
"No way.

19
00:01:22.293 --> 00:01:23.493
That's impossible!"

20
00:01:23.894 --> 00:01:24.574
Bobby said.

21
00:01:25.695 --> 00:01:26.676
Everyone laughed.

22
00:01:30.059 --> 00:01:32.821
"Hold up your index card.

23
00:01:34.002 --> 00:01:37.064
Which is bigger, the card or your face?"

24
00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:38.606
Miss Shelly asked.

25
00:01:38.626 --> 00:01:43.430
"My face," Izzie and Nina said at the same time.

26
00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:46.953
"Of course my face," Bobby said.

27
00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.495
But Jason shook his head.

28
00:01:50.535 --> 00:01:52.477
He had seen magic shows before.

29
00:01:52.497 --> 00:01:54.699
"Is this a trick question?"

30
00:01:55.139 --> 00:01:55.720
he asked.

31
00:01:56.748 --> 00:01:58.168
"I think the card is bigger."

32
00:01:58.188 --> 00:02:01.469
"You think the card is bigger?

33
00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:05.450
Let's measure and see," Miss Shelly said.

34
00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.831
"How big is the card?"

35
00:02:08.891 --> 00:02:09.772
Bobby measured.

36
00:02:10.832 --> 00:02:14.413
"13 centimeters wide and 8 centimeters tall."

37
00:02:15.613 --> 00:02:17.394
"Have you ever measured your face?"

38
00:02:17.914 --> 00:02:18.934
Miss Shelly asked.

39
00:02:22.955 --> 00:02:28.577
face is 17 centimeters long and 12 centimeters wide," Jason said.

40
00:02:28.597 --> 00:02:31.879
"So your head is bigger.

41
00:02:32.979 --> 00:02:37.681
But I bet you can fit your head through this little index card."

42
00:02:38.841 --> 00:02:40.462
Miss Shelly held up her card.

43
00:02:40.482 --> 00:02:43.443
"What? No way!"

44
00:02:43.843 --> 00:02:44.664
Jason said.

45
00:02:44.684 --> 00:02:48.185
"Impossible," Bobby said.

46
00:02:48.205 --> 00:02:52.007
"I bet Miss Shelly can do it," Izzie said.

47
00:02:53.287 --> 00:02:55.048
She smiled at her favorite teacher.

48
00:02:56.852 --> 00:03:00.414
"Well, I'll show you a trick," Miss Shelly said.

49
00:03:00.434 --> 00:03:02.755
"A magic trick?"

50
00:03:03.155 --> 00:03:03.995
Jason asked.

51
00:03:04.015 --> 00:03:06.376
"Not a magic trick.

52
00:03:07.737 --> 00:03:09.897
A real trick," she answered.

53
00:03:12.939 --> 00:03:17.501
"Step 1: Fold your card in half from top to bottom.

54
00:03:19.781 --> 00:03:25.744
Step 2: Make 13 small cuts on the folded side of your card."

55
00:03:26.812 --> 00:03:28.152
Everyone cut carefully.

56
00:03:28.172 --> 00:03:35.174
"Step 3: Make 13 small cuts on the open side of your card.

57
00:03:36.975 --> 00:03:42.536
Step 4: Carefully unfold your card and cut along the fold.

58
00:03:43.497 --> 00:03:47.378
But do not cut the first edge or the last edge.

59
00:03:48.558 --> 00:03:49.378
What do you have?"

60
00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:51.979
Jason unfolded his card.

61
00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:54.559
His eyes opened wide.

62
00:03:54.579 --> 00:03:57.749
"Wow! It's huge.

63
00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.331
And my head fits through it!"

64
00:04:00.351 --> 00:04:05.235
"But it's still just a regular index card."

65
00:04:06.476 --> 00:04:08.558
Miss Shelly put her card back together.

66
00:04:08.578 --> 00:04:12.681
"That's a cool trick, Miss Shelly," Jason said.

67
00:04:12.701 --> 00:04:15.343
"Will you teach us more like that?"

68
00:04:15.363 --> 00:04:21.368
"Sure. But right now I think your dad's waiting for you."

69
00:04:22.389 --> 00:04:23.550
She pointed to the door.

70
00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:27.619
"Dad!" Jason jumped up.

71
00:04:29.744 --> 00:04:31.107
"Want to see a cool trick?

72
00:04:32.149 --> 00:04:34.334
I can put my head through an index card!"
